Version: 1.0
desc: Sphere of Influence Ambisonic Encoder (SPARTA AmbiENC port) by chmaha
tags: spatial ambisonics encoder panner hoa 3d
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Pans up to 64 input channels into an ambisonic (spherical harmonic) scene of 1st to 7th order. Each input is
  a source with its own azimuth and elevation; direction changes cross-fade over 64 samples so moving sources
  stay click-free. Output in ACN or FuMa channel order with N3D, SN3D or FuMa normalisation, and the same
  loudspeaker presets as SPARTA. Pair it with Spin Doctor (rotation) and an ambisonic decoder.
  Ported from SPARTA AmbiENC and the Spatial_Audio_Framework by Leo McCormack
  https://github.com/leomccormack/SPARTA (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/leomccormack/Spatial_Audio_Framework (ISC)
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0 license
  Claude generated some of this code

